{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104463","id":2410812695,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PshUX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104463","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104463.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104463.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104463","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104463/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104463/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104463/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8f944a7f08252616353d7fd0229244ec1246f708","number":104463,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"`CheckButton` checked/unchecked icon can be on both sides","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"![CheckButtonLTR](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/354d8f01-c747-4821-99ef-6105ba5f5904)\r\n![CheckButtonRTL](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9b345e2-992b-4c5e-8b53-c53339f33b05)\r\n\r\nThe position of checked/unchecked icon can controlled with `check_position` theme item.\r\nIf `check_position` is `CHECK_POSITION_AUTO` checked/unchecked icon will be drawn in the right for left-to-right layouts or in the left for right-to-left layouts.\r\nIf `check_position` is `CHECK_POSITION_LEFT` checked/unchecked icon will be drawn in the left regardless of the layout direction.\r\nIf `check_position` is `CHECK_POSITION_RIGHT` checked/unchecked icon will be drawn in the right regardless of the layout direction.\r\n\r\nNaming is hard, so I'm open to name changes.\r\n\r\nInspiration: https://youtu.be/cJ5Rkk5fnGg?list=PLeG_dAglpVo6TS0q858NajyeglRuvb7hs&t=923\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undet